Method-level choices (builder's call per ODD §1.1):

  - safety_profile is a single top-level string field on
    bootstrap.yaml; default `dev` matches today's behavior.
  - production-stake floors are NON-tunable (Decision P RESOLVED
    YES); SOC-2 audit-trail floor is structural for Eric's
    compliance posture.
  - dry_run_estimate is a thin extrapolator (no model-call);
    consumes rolling-window recent-actuals; confidence_band is
    HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW based on sample-size of recent actuals.
  - .gitkeep pre-create only on fresh-scaffold and partial-
    recovery; never overwrites existing.
  - Loam-skills enrollment is via comment block in default
    bootstrap.yaml + .claude/skills/.gitkeep; the plugin has no
    loam.bootstrap.contributions entry-point so no contribution-
    list edit needed (Surface #6 refined autonomous resolution).
  - dev-sdlc plugin touch is minimal (docs entry only); no
    runtime-code change.

